        "thought_text": "Revised Thought-2: Before updating `current_sum` with the frequency of the current difficulty `k`, check if adding this frequency would make `current_sum` equal to `target`. If so, increment `valid_count`. This ensures that `current_sum` accurately represents the number of problems for ABCs up to but not including the current difficulty `k`.",
